US-015 is complete. Here's a summary of what was implemented:

**Server-side** (`gas.controller.ts`):
- Added `warnings: string[]` field to interpreted rows
- **Duplicate dates**: Detects same date+unit combinations across rows (error)
- **Range detection**: Queries existing consumption records, computes avg/stddev per unit, flags values >2 standard deviations from mean (warning)
